OL,3,GNEWSACar crashes into M&S in retail
OL,4,Apark
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car has crashed into a Marks &
OL,7,FSpencer (M&S) shop in a retail park.
OL,9,FThe collision in the Silverlink Retail
OL,10,FPark in North Tyneside happened at
OL,11,Fabout 14:15 BST.
OL,13,FTwo people were taken to hospital by
OL,14,Fthe North East Ambulance Service for
OL,15,Ftreatment.
OL,17,FPart of the retail park as been
OL,18,Fcordoned off and Northumbria Police
OL,19,Fadvised people to avoid the area. M&S
OL,20,Fsaid the store was shut and it was
OL,21,Fsupporting emergency services.
